<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 2.4 POINTS TO 765.1 PTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 2.4 POINTS TO 765.1 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 2.4 points, or 0.31 percent, on Wednesday to 765.1, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the chemistry index losing the most, down 7.1 points, or 1.95 percent, to 356.4 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
